{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>a traveling spear</b> — for it is human practice to take a spear along when campaigning." "<b>and its sarieh</b> — a type of weapon. The opinion of many: like שריון (mail), and this seems far-fetched to me. The meaning: for armor will not stand and rise against it."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:38.310220784Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}